# This file is ONLY for testing on your computer with `npx expo start`.
#
# For the real APK build, the server address comes from eas.json instead —
# see Part 4 of SETUP.md. Set it in BOTH places if you want to do both.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder as app.json) and put your real server
# address in it. This is a public web address, not a secret — your API keys
# stay on the server.
#
# Anything starting with EXPO_PUBLIC_ is baked in when the app is built, so if
# you change it you must build again.

EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-project-name.vercel.app
